 <h3><u>Mai kaise rokoo\'n</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>KEHTE THE SAYYAD E ABRAAR ME KAISE ROKOO’N<br> GHAIZ ME HE MERA JARRA ME KAISE ROKOO’N<br> EY BAHAN PHIR MERE GHAZI KO JALAL AAYA HE</p> 
  <p>1-JAB KABHI BHI MERE GHAZI KO KAHEE’N GHAIZ AYA<br> AASTEE’N ULTE HUYE BAR SAR E MAIDAA’N PAAYA<br> KARBALA DOOR HAI HAR BAAR YEHI SAMJHAYA<br> KARBALA&nbsp; AA GAEI IS BAAR ME KAISE ROKOO’N………………1</p> 
  <p>2-HAI ABHI WAQT BIN E SAAD SANBHAL LIKHA HAI<br> KHAT NAHI KHENCHA FISADAAT KA HAL LIKKHA HAI<br> DUSHMANO KE LIYE PAIGHAM E AJAL LIKHA HAI<br> GHAIZ ME HAI MERA JARRA ME KAISE ROKO’N……2</p> 
  <p>3-KHAK ME KHAK KE PAIKAR KO MILA SAKTA HAI<br> BANI E ZUL KI SARKAR GIRA SAKTA HAI<br> DASHT ME LASHO’N KE AMBAR LAGA SAKTA HAI<br> JUNG KARNE KO HAI TAYYAR ME KAISE ROKOO’N……3</p> 
  <p>4-DAR YE HAI AAG LAGA DE NA KAHEE’N PAANI ME<br> MALAKULMAUT BHI IS DAM HAI PARESHANI ME<br> KARBALA AATI HAI GHAZI KI NIGEHBANI ME<br> HATH ME NANGI HAI TALWAR ME KAISE ROKOO’N…..4</p> 
  <p>5-JAUHAR E NAFS SAR E DASHT DIKHANE KE LIYE<br> EY BEHAN KAISE KAHOO’N KHEME HATANE KE LIYE<br> HAM YAHA’N AAYE HAIN ISLAM BACHANE KE LIYE<br> ROKNA AAJ HAI DUSHWAR ME KAISE ROKKO’N…….…5</p> 
  <p>6-TEER TALWAR TABAR NEZA O KHANJAR KYA HAI<br> SAAMNE AAYE TO NAU LAKH KA LASHKAR KYA HAI<br> KHUD BATA DEGA DUA E DIL E HAIDER KYA HAI<br> HAI QAYAMAT KE SE AASAAR ME KAISE ROKO’M….…..6</p> 
  <p>7-JAANTA HOO’ KE WAFADAR HAI MERA BHAI<br> MERA MONIS MERA GHAMKHAR HAI MERA BHAI<br> MUJH PE JAA’N DENE KO TAYYAR HAI MERA BHAI<br> PHIR BHI EY ZENAB E&nbsp; LACHAAR ME KAISE ROKOO’N….….8</p> 
  <p>8 -JISKO ZEHRA NE KAHA MERA PISAR HAI ABBAS<br> WO DUA E DIL E HAIDER KA SAMAR HAI ABBAS<br> KHANDAAN E&nbsp; BANI HASHIM KA QAMAR HAI ABBAS<br> AAJ KYA KEH KE KAROO’N PYAAR ME KAISE ROKOO’N……</p> 
  <p>9-BIL YAQEE’N AAMIR O ASIF YE WAFAO’N KA IMAM<br> AASTEE’N ULTE ULAT JAYE ZAMANE KA NIZAM<br> DAM ME NAU LAKH KE LASHKAR KA KARE JEENA HARAM<br> BACH KE JAYE’N NA SITAMGAAR ME KAISE ROKOOO’N…………9</p> 
